s Twangueros and a Breese remix of Robot 84 that brings Spanish guitars firmly to the fore. <\/p>\n<p>Digital exclusives too, Quinn Lukes Different Aspirations offers I-know-this familiarity, Emerson Kitamura covers 70s classic Rock Your Baby in lullaby style, while Max Manettis Changuinola winks back towards the Happy Mondays circa 1989. <\/p>\n<p>Other highlights include Gallos Faron &#8211; currently proving the sunset bomb with Ibiza DJs J-Walks modern remake of Mazes Twilight Fuga Rontos Rework of Kay Zees Barny as a modern-day down-tempo beauty, plus Joe Morris Skies Reprise, which carries the mood dreamily off into the night. A dozen true pearlers, each one confident and ready to take their place amongst any quality collection.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"7000","regular_price":"7000","sale_price":"7000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"EUR","currency_symbol":"\u20ac","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ac"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><bdi>70,00&nbsp;<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&euro;<\/span><\/bdi><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":38923,"src":"https:\/\/www.divertrecords.sk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/1100-1100-various-balearic-4-balearic-blrc4lp-vinyl-second-hand-divert-records.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.divertrecords.sk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/1100-1100-various-balearic-4-balearic-blrc4lp-vinyl-second-hand-divert-records-600x600.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/www.divertrecords.sk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/1100-1100-various-balearic-4-balearic-blrc4lp-vinyl-second-hand-divert-records.jpg 1100w, https:\/\/www.divertrecords.sk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/1100-1100-various-balearic-4-balearic-blrc4lp-vinyl-second-hand-divert-records-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.divertrecords.sk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/1100-1100-various-balearic-4-b